---
import MediaSlot from '../MediaSlot.astro';
import GitArt from '../art/GitArt.astro';
import Logo from '../Logo.astro';
---
<section class="section feature" id="git" aria-labelledby="git-title">
	<div class="container split">
		<div class="copy head">
			<p class="eyebrow">06 — Git assist</p>
			<h2 id="git-title">Commit messages and conflicts, <span class="muted">from the Source Control view.</span></h2>
			<p class="lede">
				<em>Sirius: Generate Commit Message</em> writes the message from your diff — an imperative summary under 72
				characters, then the why. Merge conflicts go to the agent: it reads both sides of every conflict and
				proposes a resolution for each conflict and explains it; you review every one as a diff.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="demo">
			<MediaSlot name="git-assist" label="The Source Control view in Sirius: the commit message generated from the staged changes, with two modified files listed."><GitArt /></MediaSlot>
		</div>
		<div class="copy more">
			<ul class="points">
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>Into the commit box.</b> The message lands in the Source Control input, staged diff first, working tree if nothing is staged — from the Command Palette or the view's own action.</div></li>
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>Any model, including local.</b> Both run through the model you have selected — a hosted one or the Ollama model on your machine.</div></li>
				<li><Logo size={20} class="pt-icon" /><div><b>No model, no mystery.</b> Without a configured model the command tells you exactly what to do: add a provider key with <em>Sirius: Set API Key</em>, or start Ollama.</div></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "demo head" "demo more"; column-gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); row-gap: 1.75rem; align-items: center; }
	.head { grid-area: head; align-self: end; }
	.more { grid-area: more; align-self: start; }
	.demo { grid-area: demo; }
	.copy h2 { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.copy .lede { margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: var(--text-m); }
	.points { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
	.points li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 20px 1fr; gap: 0.85rem; align-items: start; color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: var(--text-s); line-height: 1.55; }
	.points b { color: var(--fg); }
	.points :global(.pt-icon) { margin-top: 0.3em; }
	@media (max-width: 900px) { .split { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "head" "demo" "more"; row-gap: 2.25rem; } }
</style>
